ripple (0.2.0-1+leste1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Adding the Lazarus/GTK2 watch-app manager with a Hildon launcher and icon.
  * Adding paged Rebble browsing, search, screenshots, and app details.
  * Supporting watch-app installation and UUID-based removal, including apps
    installed by another companion, with launch confirmation on firmware 3+.
  * Preserving notification-daemon operation around watch access and retrying
    temporarily busy Bluetooth connections.
  * Verifying HTTPS downloads and validating PBW metadata, sizes, and CRCs.
  * Converting screenshot pixels before GTK2 drawing to prevent monochrome
    PNG crashes, and adding preview and installation regression tests.

 -- Norayr Chilingarian <norayr@arnet.am>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:41:30 +0400

